---
title: "Partial recovery statechart"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  state "Closed" as s0
  state "Open" as s1
  state "Half-open" as s2
  s1 --> s2: Execution requested [Recovery delay elapsed] / Reserve trial slot and start supplied work
  s2 --> s0: Trial counted successful [Completing trial belongs to the current Half-open state] / Close and release waiting executions
  s2 --> s1: Trial counted failed [Completing trial belongs to the current Half-open state] / Restart backoff and release waiting executions
  note right of s2
    Shared breaker role#59; default single trial, no reentrant<br/>entry calls. Static partial account#59; not all<br/>configurations of P.
    Success and failure here are breaker classifications.<br/>An error outside the handled failure policy can count<br/>as recovery success while still being delivered to its<br/>caller.
  end note
